OL,4,G1300FStuart Maconie
OL,5,     GThe weekend is basically here, so
OL,6,     GStuart is giving YOU permission
OL,7,     Gto start the party early...
OL,8,     GThat's right, let's Down Tools
OL,9,     Gwith LOADS of amazing tunes to
OL,10,     Gget us going.
OL,11,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,12,     GIt's Friday, so Huw is out to
OL,13,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,14,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,15,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,16,     Gwhat you want to hear.
